mselves
as Lojbanists; however, the toxic attitude that=E2=80=99s so prominent amon=
g the
members of the community ultimately makes them want to quit engaging in it,
at least within the official venues like the IRC channel.

I don=E2=80=99t know if I have much more to say. But most importantly, y=E2=
=80=99all=E2=80=99s
utter inability to =E2=80=98read the room=E2=80=99 and understand the needs=
 of those who=E2=80=99ve
